            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Chapter 3 — Health: The Ultimate Treasure"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.082,
            0.745,
            0.169
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11. When our body encounters a pathogen for the first time, the immune response is generally low but on exposure to the same pathogen again, the immune response by the body is much more compared to the first exposure. Why is it so?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.189,
            0.482,
            0.211
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Discover, design, and debate"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.235,
            0.743,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Students maintain a health diary for at least a month to track food, hygiene, exercise, sleep, screen time, and emotional state."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.306,
            0.743,
            0.371
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Read about Indian scientists like Suniti Solomon, Asima Chatterjee, Yellapragada Subbarao, Mary Poonen Lukose for their contributions in the field of health and diseases."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.377,
            0.743,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The deadly disease smallpox was eradicated by vaccination. Discover how this was done and why it worked. Debate whether everyone should be required to get vaccinated to protect others."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.748,
            0.306,
            0.971,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": [
            {
