        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.47,
            0.744,
            0.577
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "According to current guidelines, learn the correct sequence of steps for performing cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR) on an adult in case of sudden stoppage of breathing. School may invite a doctor or a professional to demonstrate a mock drill."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.584,
            0.743,
            0.649
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Invite a doctor to the school. Students may be encouraged to interact with the doctor on the issues of malnutrition, under-nutrition, and over-nutrition."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.655,
            0.744,
            0.72
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z If you are given an opportunity to create a health card, what all would you like to include in it. Create your own health card and have discussion about it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
